type: dataset
title: "Reproducibility package for Computational Identification of Candidate Gene Families for Volatile Sulfur Compound Biosynthesis in Cannabis sativa Using Profile Hidden Markov Models"
abstract: >-
  Query definitions, analysis code, search assignments, staged validation
  results, retained candidate sequences, expression cross-references, PF01053
  phylogenetic artifacts, and manuscript presentation code supporting a survey
  of Cannabis sativa protein candidates.
